<BaseLayout title="Privacy | Trade Avata"><section class="page"><div class="shell article-body"><span class="eyebrow">LEGAL</span><h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1><p>Trade Avata uses account information to provide access to member features, learning progress, purchased products, support and personalized workspace settings. Information should only be collected when it is needed to provide or secure the service.</p><h2>Account and service data</h2><p>Account details may include your name, email address, profile settings and service activity. When you choose to connect trading services, additional account metadata and trading records may be processed for the features you request.</p><h2>Security</h2><p>Passwords, payment credentials and broker credentials should be handled by the relevant secure authentication, payment or connection service. Trade Avata does not display sensitive credentials in public-facing pages.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can contact Trade Avata to ask about account information, support records or privacy questions. Some records may need to be retained where required for security, payments, legal obligations or platform integrity.</p><h2>Updates</h2><p>This policy may be updated when services, providers or legal requirements change. The current version will be published on this page.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
